            </note>
            <note corresp="#d16-f2" n="2" xml:id="d16-f2-content">
                <p>The North Atlantic Treaty was signed in Washington on April 4, 1949, and entered
                    into force on August 24, 1949. (63 Stat. 2241)</p>
            </note>
